# GolferGeek AI Dev Curriculum

## One organizational playbook

- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for the repository passport.
- Canonical skills and agents live in [`ai/`](../../ai/README.md).
- Cursor-native generated skills and agents live in `.cursor/skills/` and
  `.cursor/agents/`.
- Claude Code and Codex projections are generated from the same source.

## What to do in Cursor

1. Open [docs/phases/00/STARTER-KIT.md](../../docs/phases/00/STARTER-KIT.md).
2. Execute the workflow in order: intention → PRD → plan → implement or
   delegate → verify.
3. Use the generated Cursor skills and agents when their descriptions match
   the work.
4. Write durable decisions and evidence to the documented repository paths,
   not only to chat history.
5. After canonical tooling changes, run `npm run ai:generate` and
   `npm run ai:check`.
